256	    /// Reads and drops the mix until the video pump has left, after the audio pump stopped
257	    /// early: an output nobody reads starves the other (G-17), and the video pump sees the
258	    /// stop only between its reads, so it must be able to finish the one it is in.
259	    private func drain(_ output: AVAssetReaderOutput) {
